Copyright 2026 Aura Launcher contributors

This product includes software rewritten from the unpublished AuraUI React
prototype (desktop design prototype for the Aura Launcher Modern UI). The
Vue 3 implementation is a fresh Apache-2.0 codebase; visual design tokens and
layout concepts originate from that prototype.

This product includes software developed by the HMCL Contributors
(https://github.com/HMCL-dev/HMCL) under GPLv3, used through the
Aura Launcher GPL lineage only on the JVM side; this repository contains no
HMCL source code.

The original AuraUI React prototype at `C:\Users\ACX\Desktop\AuraUI` is an
archived, read-only design reference. It carries no license, is not part of
this repository's distribution, and no source code from it is copied into
the Apache-2.0 Vue implementation; only independently reimplemented design
concepts and rewritten UI text are shared.
